; The White Downs' warden (.ai/second-half.md 4.2, F3): the hunter the sky lost, who draws on the wizard along a
; lane that follows him, cut short at the first barrow (UnstrungHunterBoss.cs). A tall lean man beside a bow, so a
; narrower body than the Constable's; he stalks and keeps his range rather than closing, so a slower walk. The
; draw is BossEnemy's slam as a Line (SlamRadius its reach on open ground, SlamTelegraphSeconds its wind-up, the
; last DrawLockSeconds of it held still). Health and the Arcane bonus are BossCatalog's [14] block.
